ioche's bakery!\u00a0</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A total of 27 drawings, 9 per character, you start with a basic drawing of a character and as you progress it will show the next one, which includes the character becoming lewder and bigger!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2 Full drawings of each character, a<strong> Standard</strong>\u00a0one which is won by seeing all 8 progression images of that character, and a<strong> Perfect</strong>\u00a0one that is obtained by finishing the first 9 levels before the timer runs out!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >11<strong> Running Fractals</strong>\u00a0that will randomly spawn and run across the screen! They don't affect the gameplay, but aren't they cute? Try to see them all! (Purely random)</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gameplay</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can move left and right, and use the the interact button (space in computer, X/A in controller) to take or place a pastry. You must organize the pastries so you form all of them into columns of 6 each. Once you finish 9 levels, you will unlock the standard CG and perfect CG if you beat it before the timer ended! After this, you can keep playing indefinitely until you return to the main menu to try out the other levels!\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are <strong>3 different levels</strong>! We present our staff!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Brioche</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The owner of the bakery, loves money and can't wait to get you to work! <strong>This game mode is the basic mode</strong>, where you sort your pastries to gain points!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3387640/extras/16a4a290a8672532eb7bdc8a1deebad4.poster.avif?t=1751117023\" width=720 height=404 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3387640/extras/16a4a290a8672532eb7bdc8a1deebad4.webm?t=1751117023\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3387640/extras/16a4a290a8672532eb7bdc8a1deebad4.mp4?t=1751117023\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ichigoko</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A phoenix from a different world! She's super excited to work here, but be careful! <strong>When you grab a pastry, it will start burning...</strong> Leave it alone for too long and<strong><i> Fwoosh</i></strong>\u00a0it will burn!... But don't worry, you can still make it into a column, but it will net you less points!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3387640/extras/ead592d93c12fba425980623b6faa00b.poster.avif?t=1751117023\" width=720 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3387640/extras/ead592d93c12fba425980623b6faa00b.webm?t=1751117023\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3387640/extras/ead592d93c12fba425980623b6faa00b.mp4?t=1751117023\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Aethra</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A wandering star who loves experimenting new things! She has done many weird things before for money or food, so when she saw the &quot;Free food&quot; sign, she had 0 doubts and went in! Aethra's powers will <strong>turn all the pastries in the board into stars</strong> for a brief moment! So memorize it well, and sort away!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.st